<title>JAPAN: Mos Food extends gains on buy-back plan.</title>
<headline>Mos Food extends gains on buy-back plan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Mos Food Services Inc climbed for a seventh consecutive day and hit a fresh high for the calendar year on Thursday.</p>
<p>Buying was again encouraged by the hamburger-chain operator's announcement last month that it would repurchase 3.47 million of its own shares, traders said.</p>
<p>Mos Food's shares stood 90 yen higher at 2,100 at 0139 GMT, after touching a new 1997 high of 2,120. Volume was 93,000 shares.</p>
</text>
